              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara wasagala miaka gana mwenga mirongo miiri na sabaa ndipho achifwa. Wafwa Kiriathi-Ariba (yani Heburoni), kahi ya tsi ya Kanani. Burahimu wamsononekera na achimririra Sara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.1+GEN.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.1",
              "GEN.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
